{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1493464-core-dimensional-and-time-powers","id":1493464,"title":"[Core] Dimensional and Time Powers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-21T03:50:37-07:00","id":1493464,"title":"[Core] Dimensional and Time Powers","content":"After watching &quot;Everything Everywhere All at Once&quot; and &quot;Doctor Strange Multiverse of Madness&quot; I started to think about all the different ways Dimensional and Time powers would work.<br /> <br /> I would divide the powers into 3 groups: Access, Control and Warp.<br /> <br /> Access has the minimum impact in the dimensional/time flow. The character can reach the otherselves, gaining temporarily their skills and sense their realities or time periods. The power is all about bringing part of the other reality or time to the original one.<br /> <br /> Control is the intermediary level, as you don't travel to the dimension physically. The character take control of the otherselves, allowing the character to change the other reality or time, but not going there physically, leaving an unconscious body while controlling the otherselves. The power is about controlling the other reality remotely.<br /> <br /> Warp has the most impact in the dimension/time flow, as there is a physical change in the period. The character travels physically to the other dimensions or time periods.<br /> <br /> Examples of Access would work like Doctor Manhatan being aware of his entire existence all the time (its kind of the extreme for time awareness), visions of the future and past. It would work much like Matrix having new skills downloaded to their minds, but in fact downloading from the otherselves.<br /> Examples of Control would work like the characters in EEAO or Wanda in DSMM controling their otherselves or Wolverine controlling his past self in Days of Future Past.<br /> Examples of Warp would work as most time travel and dimension travel references, with portals or teleportation to other dimensions/times.<br /> <br /> There is also the powers related to sidestep to the space between realities, basically a Warp power, but its complex to define, even knowing Mist/&quot;astral plane&quot; is a real thing in TC.<br /> <br /> Would you add any other kind of effect with this ideas in mind?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-21T04:00:20-07:00","id":1493465,"title":"","content":"Great ideas, need to mull them over. But here... <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1493464-core-dimensional-and-time-powers#post1493464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is also the powers related to sidestep to the space between realities, basically a Warp power, but its complex to define, even knowing Mist/&amp;quot;astral plane&amp;quot; is a real thing in TC.<br /> <br /> Would you add any other kind of effect with this ideas in mind?</div> </div> </div> </div>Astral Plane is real in Trinity? \ud83d\ude32 How? Where it is? On what themes it works? Where is described?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-21T04:09:03-07:00","id":1493466,"title":"","content":"In Media Res. I dont have it at hand now, but it's in a side box in the setting about stealing some weird tech, and the name is Mist.<br /> <br /> Its not an Astral Plane as in DnD, but it is the space between realities, so its more like Penumbra than astral plane, and it doesn't connect to some weird worlds, but to alternative realities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts